From the Safety and Security Chapter of the GPAI Code of Practice, within Measure 3.5 (Post-market monitoring); this chunk covers example monitoring methods (user feedback, bug bounties, community evaluations, provenance logging, use-restriction breach tracking) and the requirement to give independent external evaluators free access to the model's most capable and least-mitigated versions, unless it is a 'similarly safe or safer model'.

